    "title": "MICROSERVICE_TEST-DEV_Bus Tracking API",
    "description": "The Bus Tracking API provides real-time information about bus locations and statuses, empowering users to track their transportation. This API supports request for bus tracking data, allowing consumers such as mobile apps and web platforms to integrate tracking capabilities seamlessly. With this data, users can enhance the commuter experience by providing accurate arrival times and enabling better planning for their journeys. Use cases include informing riders of delays, estimating arrival times, and assisting transport services in operational decision-making.",
